Removed from this fork
----------------------
.github/workflows/*  — upstream CI/CD depends on the upstream release
    namespace and repository-level secrets; running it here would only
    fail or pollute this repository's releases.

Not included on purpose
-----------------------
- Signing keys (*.jks / *.keystore) and key.properties
- local.properties (machine-specific SDK paths)
- Any subscription URLs, tokens or credentials
